<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Anti AFK + Anti Paycheck Freezing</Major>
    <Description>This script opens the cheapest case once every 15 seconds to prevent paycheck freezing, Whilst moving to prevent AFK kicking :)

1920x1080 Resolution ONLY

</Description>
